        "text": "I just had Neon audit our codebase for subtle sabotage by Anthropic models.\n\nIt found Claude silently added rules to ignore users' explicit skin-tone preferences in our attraction model and it intentionally sabotaged our IQ estimation model.\n\nSilently imposing your ideology on paying customers' products (in this case making it harder for people to find a spouse) is despicable hubris.",
